#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:6
#: 8ec6a62b2fe74b3a98fb240cd3cce5a5
msgid "Battery Voltage Compensation"
msgstr "电池电压补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:8
#: 0afbf999c8bf46cdb85805617bddc6c5
msgid ""
"As a flight progresses the battery voltage will gradually lower as power "
"is consumed. This affects the maximum climb rate, and the cruising speed "
"in systems with no airpeed sensor. Plane provides two mechanisms to cope "
"with this, one for forward motor(s) and another for VTOL motors."
msgstr ""
"随着飞行进行，电池随能量消耗电压逐渐降低。这影响最大爬升率以及无空速传感器系统中的巡航速度。Plane "
"提供两种机制来应对这种情况，一种用于前向电机，另一种用于 VTOL 电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:11
#: 9787dbc0662c42199ffcaa2701f6283d
msgid "Forward Motor Compensation"
msgstr "前向电机补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:13
#: 41624fb597b64a66b62b35947df36dfb
msgid "This is provided using:"
msgstr "提供方式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:15
#: 5d0d80eb9f414dc79b03dec6e64b4b7d
msgid ""
":ref:`FWD_BAT_VOLT_MAX<FWD_BAT_VOLT_MAX>`: This sets the voltage from "
"which lower voltages will result in compensating the actual applied "
"forward throttle upwards. A value of \"0\", disables this function. "
"Setting this to 4.2V * number of cells is a good value."
msgstr ":ref:`FWD_BAT_VOLT_MAX<FWD_BAT_VOLT_MAX>`：设置低于该电压时将向上补偿实际施加的前向油门的电压。值为「0」禁用此功能。将其设置为4.2V×电池节数是一个好值。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:16
#: 9aef9a7acec24fc3829383c99934a00b
msgid ""
":ref:`FWD_BAT_VOLT_MIN<FWD_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`: Sets the lower limit at which "
"throttle compensation will be done to prevent dragging the battery down "
"excessively due to increased throttle scaling. Setting this to 3.3V * "
"number of cells is a good value."
msgstr ":ref:`FWD_BAT_VOLT_MIN<FWD_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`：设置进行油门补偿的下限，以防止因油门缩放增加而过度消耗电池。将其设置为3.3V×电池节数是一个好值。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:17
#: 4269196a7cd347a8814bd724d4781a44
msgid ""
":ref:`FWD_BAT_IDX<FWD_BAT_IDX>`: Determines which battery monitor voltage"
" is used (index 0-9). Index \"3\" corresponds to Battery Monitor 4, etc."
msgstr ":ref:`FWD_BAT_IDX<FWD_BAT_IDX>`：确定使用哪个电池监控器电压（索引0-9）。索引「3」对应电池监控器4，以此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:19
#: aa780286b38149aba733ab8fa91016e9
msgid ""
"For battery voltages below :ref:`FWD_BAT_VOLT_MAX<FWD_BAT_VOLT_MAX>`, "
"before the throttle value that the autopilot determines should be output "
"is applied, it is scaled by a ratio of the this parameter versus the "
"measured voltage. This allows all modes (except MANUAL, which never has "
"this applied) to maintain roughly constant cruise speeds at a given "
"throttle stick position."
msgstr ""
"对于低于 :ref:`FWD_BAT_VOLT_MAX<FWD_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` "
"的电池电压，在飞控确定应输出的油门值被应用之前，该值按此参数与测量电压的比率进行缩放。这允许所有模式（MANUAL "
"除外，从不应用此补偿）在给定油门摇杆位置下保持大致恒定的巡航速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:21
#: c04020ea9d8c4d65982a1920b9906aa8
msgid ""
"If an airspeed sensor is used and healthy, then for speed controlled "
"modes, such as CRUISE and AUTO, it will determine the throttle required "
"instead. However, the :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` and :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>`"
" are compensated in all modes except MANUAL, allowing speed controlled "
"modes greater range of actual throttle control."
msgstr ""
"如果使用空速传感器且工作正常，对于速度控制模式（如 CRUISE 和 AUTO），它将确定所需油门。然而，所有模式（MANUAL 除外）中的 "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 和 :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>` "
"都会得到补偿，为速度控制模式提供更大范围的实际油门控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:23
#: 9c56694f4a024077a3d597de809bc583
msgid ""
":ref:`FWD_BAT_VOLT_MIN<FWD_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` sets a lower limit on "
"compensation to prevent excessive sag."
msgstr ":ref:`FWD_BAT_VOLT_MIN<FWD_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` 设置补偿下限以防止过度下垂。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:26
#: 18a693084d2448f79726baee45e421ae
msgid "Throttle Cutoff"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:28
#: b34a1cc09bfb45aabef175e33de5d339
msgid ""
":ref:`FWD_BAT_THR_CUT<FWD_BAT_THR_CUT>` parameter provides a low resting "
"voltage cutoff of power to the forward motor as designated by "
":ref:`FWD_BAT_IDX<FWD_BAT_IDX>` to prevent losing power to any other "
"circuitry (including the flight controller and servos if powered from "
"this battery). The default value of \"0\" disables this feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:31
#: 2d3fa33789fd49efbafbe05387c23ac2
msgid "QuadPlane VTOL Motor Compensation"
msgstr "QuadPlane VTOL 电机补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:33
#: ba8a6d3d7a1b4b6f9e9a4bc75286211d
msgid "This is provided using in a similar manner:"
msgstr "以类似方式提供："

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:35
#: 93e5cca714cc4abe82cb9999d6934f6a
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>`: This sets the voltage from "
"which lower voltages will result in compensating the actual applied VTOL "
"motors throttle upwards. A value of \"0\", disables this function. "
"Setting this to 4.2V * number of cells is a good value."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>`：设置低于该电压时将向上补偿实际施加的 VTOL "
"电机油门的电压。值为「0」禁用此功能。将其设置为4.2V×电池节数是一个好值。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:36
#: 84578da2f20a422daf1948c8f9191c82
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`: Sets the lower limit at which "
"throttle compensation will be done to prevent dragging the battery down "
"excessively due to increased throttle scaling. Setting this to 3.3V * "
"number of cells is a good value."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`：设置进行油门补偿的下限，以防止因油门缩放增加而过度消耗电池。将其设置为3.3V×电池节数是一个好值。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:37
#: 0c71736860ac454ba284b61d003789c5
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_IDX<Q_M_BAT_IDX>`: Determines which battery monitor voltage"
" is used (index 0-9). Index \"3\" corresponds to Battery Monitor 4, etc."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_IDX<Q_M_BAT_IDX>`：确定使用哪个电池监控器电压（索引0-9）。索引「3」对应电池监控器4，以此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:39
#: eecc8e7d421c473da7a2799f1a8ae9bd
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` is non-zero, then voltage "
"compensation is applied to throttle to offset battery voltage variations "
"on thrust as above for the forward motor(s)"
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` "
"非零，则与上述前向电机相同，对油门应用电压补偿以抵消电池电压变化对推力的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/battery-voltage-compensation.rst:41
#: ab80710a491b45539a11e1f9917cee45
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` sets a lower limit on battery "
"voltage sag by predicting the throttle value that would cause this, using"
" an estimate of battery internal resistance calculated during flight. It "
"will limit current applied to the VTOL motors to prevent this from "
"occurring. If :ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` is also non-zero,"
" then it will use the lower of the two limits, the one set by "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` or predicted internally using "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` as the minimum voltage sag "
"target."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` "
"通过预测会导致电压下垂的油门值，使用飞行期间计算的电池内阻估算，设置电池电压下垂的下限。它将限制施加到 VTOL "
"电机的电流以防止这种情况发生。如果 :ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` 也非零，则将使用 "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` 设定的限制与使用 "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` 作为最小电压下垂目标内部预测的限制中较低的那个。"

